   "text": "For eighty years the Turk tours the world. It beats Benjamin Franklin. And when Napoleon tries to cheat, it puts his piece back. Twice. The third time, it sweeps every piece off the board. Then in 1854, a fire burns the Turk to ash, and its secret finally comes out.",
